<title>USA: PaineWebber wins Palm Beach Cty, Fla. $95 mln TANs.</title>
<headline>PaineWebber wins Palm Beach Cty, Fla. $95 mln TANs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said it won $95 million of Palm Beach County, Fla., tax anticipation notes (TANs).</p>
<p>The net interest cost was 3.946462 percent and the coupon was 4.50 percent.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
